    "text": "Azide ion <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/decdc674-c506-4d0f-b5c4-d6ff7fb6c365-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 160px;\" /><br />Bond order:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;<br /><br />Bond Order: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />Due to the delocalisation in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> double character increase in single bond and&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></span>&nbsp;triple bond character decrease in triple bond (double bond character comes).<br />&nbsp;",
